{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"He stares at the mender.","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:36:41.465000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867444987904917564","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Master Mason... I believe we are overdue for a talk.  Join me in the cottage?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:37:06.284000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867445092004397059","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Mender. Your name is new to the rhythms and portents. You are a peer. Not an overseer.\" He states.","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:38:29.234000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867445439920734218","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"This is why I think we need to have a conversation.... If I were an overseer.... I would have removed you alltogeather for your neglect.  If you must continue your experiments in my park.... we will need to talk later.  I am thankful to be back... but not of the circumstances.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:40:36.866000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867445975249453116","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I am a man of science. You are a man of faith. We will never oversee one another. My craftwork is to progress the intentions of Empire. Changes are needed, sir.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:43:37.355000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T16:44:22.284000Z","id":"867446732274532364","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"ArcaniaBot","id":"810907841329627137","is_bot":1,"username":"ArcaniaBot"},"author_id":"810907841329627137","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"<@476553068687654922> Hello! Your long rest is over now, have a great new day in Empire City!","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:45:00.137000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867447079487668316","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"The Mender recomposes himself \"I knew men like you.... who pushed forward with no care for the past.... if this city falls due to neglect... what will your science matter?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:45:02.540000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T16:45:23.647000Z","id":"867447089565925416","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"And if the stagnations of tradition and fatih are what keeps us from moving forward? What then will you think of failure?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:46:40.382000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867447499946197012","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I saw a town of people with the world in the balance.... so focused on their goals they had no cohesion... They let war break out.... everything fall apart.... for their own personal goals.  I stand here looking to fix what is... and you push only for what might be\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:48:26.429000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T16:48:37.502000Z","id":"867447944738897931","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Fix what is? With a fixation with on what was? What might or might not be is but very survival as a people. It is all well and good to skip from conflict to conflict, but some of us don't have that luxury.'","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:50:46.676000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T16:51:45.073000Z","id":"867448532978237532","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Those that forget the past are doomed to repeat it.... but you talk of luxury.... a man of peace tied to the yoke of war... there is no luxury there....\" he shakes his head \"we will have to find a balance.... if we are to co-exist.... but letting the apple rot while polishing the skin..... seems fruitless\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:53:31.990000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T16:54:03.320000Z","id":"867449226353704970","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Why ought we to not rewrite what is written if it is not working, mender. We are beginning to wonder what efforts you are putting forward to, well, do some mending of what is in such ill condition. \"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:56:23.211000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867449944507416576","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
